{"language":"jp","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","不休撕咬"],["/skills/0/name_i18n/jp","エンドレスバイト"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","连续攻击一名敌人，并使其无法回复生命值并持续受到伤害。"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/jp","敵1体を連続で攻撃し、対象をHP回復不可にし、持続的にダメージを与える"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","狂暴地连续攻击一名敌人，持续击飞这名敌人并造成10段60% + 10% ATK伤害，最后一击造成200% + 20% ATK伤害并将敌人击倒，每段伤害额外附带敌人已损失生命值6%的伤害，且额外伤害最高不超过自身120%攻击力。本技能释放期间，哈拉克处于霸体状态，命中敌人后使敌人不能回复生命值，持续6秒，期间该敌人每秒流失40% ATK生命值。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","敵1体に猛攻を仕掛け、持続的に打ち上げ、60% + 10% ATKのダメージを10回与え、最後の一撃で200% + 20% ATKのダメージを与え、敵をノックダウンさせる。1回の攻撃につき、追加で敵のHP減少量×6%のダメージを与える。追加ダメージはハラックの攻撃力×120%を超えない。このスキルの発動中、自身はスーパーアーマー状態になり、スキルがヒットした敵は6秒間、HP回復不可になり、毎秒、40% ATKのHPが流失"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":29,"end":35,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":52,"end":58,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":23,"end":29,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":55,"end":61,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":26,"end":39,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":48,"end":62,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":126,"end":128,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"},{"start":161,"end":168,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":20,"end":33,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":51,"end":65,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":157,"end":165,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"},{"start":199,"end":206,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","连续攻击造成的伤害提升至70% + 10% ATK，最后一击造成的伤害提升至210% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","連続攻撃のダメージが70% + 10% ATKにUPし、最後の一撃のダメージが210% + 20% ATKにUP"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":21,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":42,"end":48,"pow